        Valid: `"foo"`, `"foo/bar"`, `"123"`, `"Foo-BAR_foo.bar123"`
    
        Not valid: `"datasets/foo/bar"`, `".repo_id"`, `"foo--bar"`, `"foo.git"`
    
        Example:
        ```py
